# The offline mapping needs no configuration. These are only for adapting the
# illustrative sketch into a live Agent Framework workflow on a model endpoint
# (e.g. Foundry Agent Service). Copy to .env and fill in; never commit .env.
#
# FOUNDRY_PROJECT_ENDPOINT=<your-foundry-project-endpoint>
# AZURE_TENANT_ID=<your-tenant-id>
# AZURE_CLIENT_ID=<your-client-id>
